[quote="Foote"]

 Tempest can also gain 2 DR without outside help. Are we prepared to call Tempest a Tank? Not by a longshot.&nbsp; 

[/quote]

Yes. Any game where the hero with the highest HP is target most frequently, Tempest can totally be considered a tank.

The reason I do not categorize heroes into certain roles is not only can every hero is built to take on various roles, they can also take up different roles based on the villain and environment decks. Example being Tempest, he will not be able to achieve a Tank status against someone like Citizen Dawn, but against Apostate he can absolutely shutdown a lot of his damage.&nbsp;

Not only does villain and environment decks effect the role a hero can take, but other hero decks can help out as well. Use the example before, now add The Wraith into the mix. Thanks to Smoke Bombs, Tempest can now absorb the damage from the hero target with the lowest HP. With the combined effort of two heroes, you have now made a very good tank.
